<b><color is="#f1ba50">Permadeath</color></b>: The first death makes that player a permanent spectator.\n\
<b><color is="#f1ba50">Three Strikes</color></b>: Each player has 3 lives. A player with no lives left becomes a spectator.\n\
<b><color is="#f1ba50">Nine Lives</color></b>: The world shares a pool of 9 lives. When the pool empties, the run ends for everyone.\n\
<b><color is="#f1ba50">Soulbound</color></b>: The first death ends the run for everyone.
